    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present a unique, spacious five bedroom detached bungalow with outbuilding offering huge potential on approximately 0.28 hectares / 0.69 acres. The accommodation comprises of entrance hall, lounge, kitchen, sunroom, dining room, 5 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms and utility and whilst requiring some modernisation this property has obvious potential in a most convenient location. The property is currently zoned existing residential in the Clane development plan and would possibly have potential to extend or develop conditional on normal planning requirements.\nGlendara is just a short stroll from Clane village and all the superb amenities that this thriving location has to offer including shops, schools, church, cafes, pubs, restaurants, a host of recreational facilities and a frequent public transport service. Dublin city is easily accessible via either the M4 or M7 motorways, frequent bus services or rail links available nearby at Sallins and Maynooth.\n\nViewing of this lovely home with obvious potential in a super setting is highly recommended.\n\n."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.2m x 1.8m\nWith carpet, tiled flooring, wooden ceiling, cloak room.\n\nLounge - 5.4m x 4.2m\nWith feature open fireplace, vaulted ceiling, feature timber beams, dual aspect, picture windows.\n\nDining Room - 4.2m x 4.2m\nWith carpet.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 3.8m x 3.7m\nWith fitted kitchen, Stanley oil fired cooker, tongue & groove flooring, wooden ceiling, recessed lighting.\n\nSun Room - 5.8m x 4.8m\nWith vaulted ceiling, tiled floor, French door to rear.\n\nLobby - 6.2m x 2.6m\nWith tiled floor.\n\nUtility Room - 4.2m x 3.8m\nWith tiled floor, tiled walls, fitted storage units.\n\nShower Room - 3.3m x 1.6m\nWith Triton T80si electric shower, wc, vanity whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, shower screen.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 3.0m\nWith vinyl flooring, whb, shower unit.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 3.0m\nWith fitted wardrobes, tongue & groove flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 3.0m\nWith fitted wardrobes, tongue & groove flooring, whb.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.9m x 2.9m\nWith dual aspect, fitted wardrobes, shower, whb, tiled splashback, tongue & groove flooring, French door to side.\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.7m x 2.5m\nWith tongue & groove flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.7m x 2.0m\nWith sunken bath, wc, whb, bidet, tiled floor, tiled walls.\n\nCorridor - 9.1m x 1.2m\nWith tiled carpet.\n\n"
      },
      {
